<https://purl.org/nemo/gufo-examples/objects-and-parts#> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://purl.org/nemo/gufo-examples/objects-and-parts#> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A small ontology of cars, their components, a fleet, and fuel, illustrating gUFO's classification of complex objects and its part-whole properties."@en .
<https://purl.org/nemo/gufo-examples/objects-and-parts#> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "gUFO example 02: Objects and their parts (Car fleet)"@en .
